        "methodology": "The authors combined publicly available BRFSS survey data with internal CTK patient records by aligning variables that describe demographic groups and chronic condition prevalence. Data were extracted, cleaned, and then merged on common identifiers such as year, state, age_group, sex and race_ethnic"
